actions.supported_help = E puʻe ai poloaʻiga filifiliga ua faamaonia, vaega fou/kopi/liua i pika/tuufaatasi, faatumu lanu i luma/tua, Gaussian/Box/Motion Blur, Faamaʻai, Unsharp Mask, Median, ma fetuunaʻiga.
actions.unsupported_help = E lē puʻeina togi o le pulumu, filifiliga vaega e faia saʻo, suiga o foliga, fealuaʻi i le talaaga, faamama i fafo pe faalagolago i punaoa, faamama e faafuaseʻi, faaputuga faamama, ma poloaʻiga faila/polokalame. E lē lagolagoina faasaʻoga o auala lanu moni ma fetuunaʻiga CMYK/Lab e suia tumau ai pika.
actions.replay_help = E faatatau laasaga i le vaega galue ma le filifiliga o loo iai. E toe faafoʻi e le Toe Tatala e tasi le gaoioiga atoa. A lē taulau se laasaga, e toe faafoʻi le gaoioiga atoa. E faasaʻo e pule faanumera le gaoioiga o loo galue ai; o le Teu le gaoioiga e tausia ai suiga.
